>Hey these questions may not be for 2.3 but they are just some general questions.
>1. what level is the shop on? How do I get there? What can I get there.
There are usually multiple shops, of varying types in a dungeon.  There
is no set pattern, but there will usually be at least one between levels
2 and 5.

>2. at the shop I have heard you can get more little dogs, Is that true?
I've never seen it.  I believe the only ways to get more dogs would be
to tame the dog of a ghost on a ghost level, or else have a monster
tamed with a scroll of taming get polymorphed into a dog.

>3. how does a wizard cast spells, I've learned them but how do I cast them?
It's one of the extended commands.  To see a list of them, type '#'
followed be '?'  Cast is #cast.  NetHack automatically prints the
whole command as soon as it is given an unambiguous prefix, so I
think #c<return> should do the job, but a little experimentation
should tell you what it is if I am wrong.

>4. what are some of the benefits of being a priest?
This I'm not sure about, but I may be able to help.  I'm pretty sure
You start with potions of holy water and a blessed mace.  I think you
also get spellbooks and maybe a better chance of doing well with
the gods.

>5. the same question but for a valakarie (<- sp)?
+3 shield, +1 long sword, cold resistance.

